# The build context is this producer's own directory, and only its control
# template is COPYed out of it. There is no `family` context: the payload is
# Debian-sourced, so the shared Apache copyright one level up is the wrong
# licence for it and is deliberately not reachable from here.
#
# The binary itself is not in this directory and is not a context. It is
# HARVESTED by the first stage of the Dockerfile, out of the pinned Debian
# base, which is what keeps this repository from carrying a checked-in ELF it
# did not compile.
*
!control/*.control
